      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab1fddeae0bf.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab1fdeb7b0b6.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hello everyone,&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are excited to share this mod with the Breath of the Wild community. Please note that, since we do not have a stable way to reference the original English game text, this mod is currently available only in Chinese. However, we warmly welcome anyone who would like to create and release a separate translation patch—your help would be greatly appreciated.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At the moment, the outfits in this mod do not have upgrade functionality, but we encourage interested modders to develop and publish upgradeable patches as well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod also includes high-definition icons for both outfits and weapons. The outfit icons adopt the exact same style as the Linkle 3.0 icons. We have not tested them on Zelda mods, but you are welcome to create and release custom Zelda icons if you need them—we would be happy to see that.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We plan to continue releasing more public mods in the future. In addition, we are open to custom mod commissions—if you have any specific ideas, feel free to reach out.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;To help us create better content, we are hoping to expand our team. If you are passionate about designing beautiful costumes or crafting interesting new gameplay mechanics, and would like to join us, please don't hesitate to get in touch. We would be truly grateful for your support.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you repost this mod on any other platform, we kindly ask that you credit this page. Thank you for your understanding.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where to find the items:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;· Outfits can be purchased from Beedle at Riverside Stable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;· Weapon are available at East Akkala Stable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Should you encounter any bugs, please leave a comment to let us know—we value your feedback and will do our best to address issues.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For inquiries, collaboration, or commission requests, please contact us at:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;muzihaoxhrj@gmail.com&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thank you for your interest and support—we hope you enjoy the mod!</description>
