    <item>
      <title>Twilight Trial</title>
      <author>Nebroc</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/489012</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/489012#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">90476cbe0b66a5ee86966ee3fc262026a9d6fbc4</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 16:03:57 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b01ce40a9d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b01e087c1b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b01f401aa4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/65abd8afa03e7.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b02026cd2f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b02139ef46.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b024c048cf.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b024f9fbff.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b04be08e3e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b04f04d3ae.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b04f98f368.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/659b04fce6193.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Fixed AS Error&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed an AS issue that prevented the mod from being installed on UKMM v0.16+&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Welcome to the Twilight Trial !&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hey adventurer ! &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;The Goddess Hylia needs your help&lt;/span&gt; at the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Coliseum&lt;/span&gt;. In another world, waves of enemies are attacking, &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;you have to protect Hyrule&lt;/span&gt; !&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Features&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;The &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Twilight Trial&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; adds &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;a brand new Dungeon&lt;/span&gt; to the game ! &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;To start the trial&lt;/span&gt;, go to the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Coliseum&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;pick up the Mysterious Sword in it pedestal&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;You’ll get &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;teleported&lt;/span&gt; inside the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Twilight Trial&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;fight 25 waves of enemies&lt;/span&gt; ! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Reward&lt;/span&gt; is &lt;span class="Spoiler"&gt;a &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Magic Crossbow from another Dimension&lt;/span&gt;. It deals &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;999 damages&lt;/span&gt; and sho&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;ots Light Arrows&lt;/span&gt;, but like the One-Hit Obliterator it keeps you at &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;1 quarter of heart&lt;/span&gt; while it’s equipped, so &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;use it wisel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;y&lt;/span&gt; !&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Recommendations&lt;/b&gt; &lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;I &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;strongly recommend&lt;/span&gt; to use the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Twilight Trial&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; with &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/414822"&gt;Relics of the Past&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/449653"&gt;Bigger Lynels&lt;/a&gt;, I literally made the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Twilight Trial&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to be used with them, but &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;you can still use the mod without them&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Versions of the mod&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;The &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Twilight Trial&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; features 2 versions : the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Classic&lt;/span&gt; version and the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Hard&lt;/span&gt; version. In the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Classic version&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Relics of the Past enemies have nerfed HPs&lt;/span&gt; to make the mod &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;easier in vanilla&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;No matter what version you select, &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;you &lt;b&gt;don’t&lt;/b&gt; need any other mod&lt;/span&gt;, but as I said earlier you’ll don’t get &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;the Best Experience&lt;/span&gt; without &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/449653"&gt;Bigger Lynels&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/414822"&gt;Relics of the Past&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. Special Thanks&lt;/b&gt; &lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Many thanks&lt;/span&gt; to the following people &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;who allowed me to include some parts of their mods in &lt;b&gt;Twilight Trial&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, I would never have been able to make &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;such a good mod without them&lt;/span&gt; :&lt;br&gt;- &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/1705492"&gt;ShadowMarth&lt;/a&gt; who allowed me to use some &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Enemies and Weapons&lt;/span&gt; from &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/414822"&gt;Relics of the Past&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;- &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/samu_wel_elsch/" target="_blank"&gt;Samu&lt;/a&gt;, who made the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;original design of the Malice&lt;/span&gt; (purple) &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Moblin&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;- &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/2328261"&gt;Harlock&lt;/a&gt;, creator of &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/411280"&gt;The Sheikah Tried&lt;/a&gt;, I used the &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Project001&lt;/span&gt; at &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Wave 10&lt;/span&gt; !&lt;br&gt;- &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/1797815"&gt;Arch Leaders&lt;/a&gt;, who allowed me to include &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;some actors&lt;/span&gt; from &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/307642"&gt;Vanilla Actors with Collision&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;And obviously &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;many thanks to my friends&lt;/span&gt; for their &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;help&lt;/span&gt; and their &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;feedbacks&lt;/span&gt; about the mod !&lt;br&gt;- &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/2191196"&gt;Charlie92155&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;- &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/2737445"&gt;Gojo the Hobo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;- &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/1676542"&gt;Waikuteru&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you enjoy this mod, don’t forget to &lt;span class="GreenColor SelectedElement"&gt;&lt;b&gt;leave a like&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/1920307"&gt;check my other mods&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt; !</description>
